{"v":4,"catch":"一個廣闊的忍者故事，包含 8 種忍者魔法和神秘角色！","desc":"《NINJA EMAKI》是 Nichibutsu 於 1986 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n控制年輕的英雄Shinbei，為從惡靈大軍手中拯救公主而戰。\n拿起捲軸即可獲得 8 種不同的忍者魔法。 明智地使用它們，它們將成為遊戲中前進的關鍵！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-07-04","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aae31a4886ade23f9c0a10e0cb69fcb0e51996318658647c606363a67ddcb461.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da97e5dd7c8e4c5b29fa22468fdd468013470d93372ca0f778c0e66738cd535b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/12877770fda37710af5f3512fd4fc07aba39594111c2142cda6083ff2a8062fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3320b180d7e4f5f58dc80fc64f44e70ccdce4e06a638f3f4f362c673cc17bb8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91d5324ae4bd837bd237344c9968a283dbbef2b23758a665b5b9caa4942758bd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7fa81029aeaf20384674ddbdf42022fccff56ef960cdfb02f299ec7ff098f97b.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d6001d18c000","dlc":[]}